EXTERNAL SERVICES (optional, accessed over the network; not part of this repo)
LanguageTool public API - grammar checking https://languagetool.org/
MyMemory - translation https://mymemory.translated.net/
Ollama + local models - dialogue https://ollama.com/
Google Translate TTS - speech (via gTTS; an unofficial, undocumented endpoint
that may change, be rate-limited or blocked at any time)

Published free-tier limits: LanguageTool public API - 20 requests/min, 75 KB/min, 20 KB per request,
no automated requests; MyMemory anonymous - 5000 characters/day, 500 bytes per request.
The app enforces stricter limits of its own before every call (see app/limits.py).
Use of these services is subject to their own terms of service and rate
limits. Text typed in the "Conversation" section may be sent to LanguageTool
and MyMemory. Each language model downloaded through Ollama has its own license.

